# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) and uncomment what you need. Vite bakes these into the build: public values only.

# -- sign-in (Clerk) ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Publishable key from the Clerk dashboard (API keys). With it set, the desk at /desk needs a session; sign-in is at
# /sign-in. In the dashboard, set the sign-in URL to /sign-in and add this app's origin to the allowed origins.
# The API needs the matching LOANDESK_CLERK_ISSUER (see the repo's .env.example).
# Unset: a production build never opens the desk; `npm run dev` offers a dev-only way in (the API is open then too).
# VITE_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_...

# -- desk API -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Where the desk API runs (default http://localhost:8100). Its LOANDESK_CORS_ORIGINS must include this app's origin.
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8100
